    "translation": "Original-language poem only; modern translations and recordings are separate. Retain attribution and source/license links for copyrightable transcription material. English passage: Fresh English translation by ChatGPT; draft for editorial review. 12-line passage on printed p.68. Original and English cells contain the same selection; line breaks are reading lines, not a claim of manuscript typography.",
