      "english": "There is nothing in this life\nGreater than love;\nIf God has no measure,\nLove is greater still.\nGreater than the sea, than the sky,\nBut, above all, my own beloved\nIs greater still.\nThe sweetest beloved\nIs the one who is mine;\nThey are the key\nThat opens my heaven.\nThe sweetest beloved\nIs the one who loves me;\nAh, if I lost them,\nDeath would come.",
