    "translation": "Journal says the sonnet had been preserved in Margarita Martínez’s album and was unpublished until then. Original sonnet only; modern library descriptions and other journal contributions are separate. The selection is the original-language text; an existing English translation is not required. Passage update (29 October 2026): Complete sonnet, 14 lines. Two OCR slips in the 1920 scan are corrected (“cum bre” to “cumbre”, “Su” to “su”); the wording is unchanged. Fresh English translation by Claude (Anthropic AI); draft for editorial review.",
