    "location": "Complete original poem",
    "translation": "Author died 1919. This covers the original poem only, not the musical setting or recordings. Textual versions differ, so compare an early print for the chosen passage. Contains a suicidal declaration; not an uncomplicated positive-love choice. The selection is the original-language text; an existing English translation is not required. English passage: Fresh English translation by ChatGPT; draft for editorial review. Lines 5–16, three consecutive stanzas; opening and closing omitted. Original and English cells contain the same selection; line breaks are reading lines, not a claim of manuscript typography.",
