    "translation": "Medieval Georgian original is public domain. Exact modern base edition of the transcription is not stated; stanza numbering can vary. Do not reuse a modern English translation by assumption. The selection is the original-language text; an existing English translation is not required. Passage update (29 October 2026): Prologue stanzas 24–26, 12 lines, on true love and lust. Fresh English translation by Claude (Anthropic AI); draft for editorial review.",
