      "english": "And what I most wish to happen\nFor my maddened heart. “Whom now shall I persuade\nTo lead you back into her love? Who, O\nSappho, wrongs you?\nFor if she flees, soon she will pursue;\nIf she will not take gifts, she will give them;\nAnd if she does not love, soon she will love,\nEven against her will.”\nCome to me now as well, and free me from harsh\nCares; all that my heart longs\nTo bring about, bring about; and you yourself\nBe my ally.",
