    "contextNote": "Rubén Darío, the founder of modernismo, transformed poetry in Spanish on both sides of the Atlantic. This sonnet, from his years of travel between Latin America and Europe, sets a Paris winter scene with the luxury and faraway objects that modernismo loved.",
